title = "Dog Tag, Bunk 14"
type = 3
text = "A dog tag hanging from the frame of bunk 14. The name is scratched off, but the number isn't: 14.\nScratched into the wall above the bunk, in tiny letters:\nELI - I'M SORRY I'M LATE. I'M STILL COMING HOME."
